{"id":"vod_hh_175730","vodId":"175730","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"暗芝居第一季","name_cn":"暗芝居第一季","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第13集完结","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/df13558701491f3990160619271c02d4.jpg"},"summary":"本片是一部带有浓郁昭和气息的怪谈动画，每集开头均为傍晚黄昏，著名实力派男星津田宽治配音的江湖艺人高声吆喝，招揽顾客，以洋片（紙芝居）的形式讲述一个又一个短小精悍却恐怖阴森的都市怪谈。如新搬入的公寓贴着奇怪符咒、不断能印出发丝的复印机、为了防止被上身而不得不彻夜欢笑的家族、直通地下13层的诡异电梯……每集均在最紧张时刻戛然而止，使观者在恐慌之际又留下无限回味空间，其风格与《新耳袋》和《毛骨悚然撞鬼经》有异曲同工之妙。故做古旧拙朴的画面和风格幽异的片尾曲，更加为这部短剧增色不少。此外，官网还不定期提供短篇小说","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-08-12 09:30:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/bmZyQqrd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/erk90wka/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aKrQOnze/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/bDk8RvBa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/elY7O3Ja/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aAD1n51e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/b82EqJle/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/erk903wa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/b2kWR0Jd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/eVOQmE5a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aM81jrQe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/elY7O3la/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集完结","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aQW71wqd/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:57.981Z"}